    {
      "q": "What services are available for the motor vehicle industry?",
      "a": "Services include obtaining a motor vehicle repairer licence, dealing with motor dealers, getting a motor vehicle recycler licence, and obtaining a motor vehicle tradesperson certificate.",
      "link": "https://www.service.nsw.gov.au/services/motor-vehicle-repairer-licence"
    },
    {
      "q": "What services are available for the road transport industry?",
      "a": "Services cover heavy vehicles, road freight, tow trucks, public passenger vehicles (taxis, buses, and hire cars), and bus tour operator accreditation.",
      "link": "https://www.service.nsw.gov.au/services/heavy-vehicles"
    },
    {
      "q": "How can I check a business or trade licence?",
      "a": "You can check a business or trade licence using the dedicated service.",
